  "text": "**Alex:** So, have you seen the new art exhibit downtown?  \n**Jamie:** No, I haven\u2019t. Is it worth the time?  \n**Alex:** Definitely. The abstract pieces are insane. You have to see the one with the glowing colors.  \n**Jamie:** Wait, the one with the glowing colors?  \n**Alex:** Yeah, it\u2019s like\u2026 the whole piece is alive. The lighting changes depending on where you stand.  \n**Jamie:** Oh, that sounds trippy.  \n**Alex:** Totally. I tried to take a photo, but the light was too intense. My phone died.  \n**Jamie:** No way. That\u2019s rough.  \n**Alex:** I know. I had to leave halfway through. My brain was melting.  \n**Jamie:** I can imagine. You okay?  \n**Alex:** Yeah, just needed a walk. It\u2019s kind of like a sensory overload, you know?  \n**Jamie:** Yeah, I feel that. I\u2019ve been feeling overwhelmed lately.  \n**Alex:** That\u2019s rough. What\u2019s going on?  \n**Jamie:** Just work, you know. Too much on my plate.  \n**Alex:** I get it. Maybe check out the exhibit next week? I\u2019ll come with.  \n**Jamie:** You would?  \n**Alex:** Yeah. I think it might help. Or at least get us out of our heads for a while.  \n**Jamie:** That sounds nice. Thanks.  \n**Alex:** No problem. Let me know when you\u2019re free.  \n**Jamie:** I\u2019ll text you.  \n**Alex:** Cool. See you then.  \n**Jamie:** See you.",
